OL,3,GNEWSAFormer nurse jailed for sexually
OL,4,Aassaulting patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nurse who sexually assaulted a
OL,7,Ffemale patient whilst working at an NHS
OL,8,Fhospital has been jailed for seven
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FErnest Paul Cruz attacked the woman in
OL,12,Fa room at the Royal Bournemouth
OL,13,FHospital in July 2023, after she had
OL,14,Fvisited the hospital's emergency
OL,15,Fdepartment.
OL,17,FFollowing a trial at Bournemouth Crown
OL,18,FCourt earlier this year, Cruz was found
OL,19,Fguilty of sexual assault and assault by
OL,20,Fpenetration.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
