OL,4,Aassaulting patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a hearing at the same court on
OL,7,FMonday, the 38-year-old former nurse
OL,8,Fwas sentenced to seven years in prison
OL,9,Fand placed on the sex offenders
OL,10,Fregister.
